---

## 3️⃣ Classic Must‑Sees (always popular, great for a family itinerary)

| # | Attraction | Why it’s a family hit | Typical cost | Best time to visit |
|---|------------|-----------------------|--------------|--------------------|
| **1** | **Mount Royal Park** (Parc du Mont‑Royal) | Large playgrounds, Beaver Lake paddle‑boats, easy walking trails, city views from the Kondiaronk Belvedere. | Free (boat rentals $5‑$7) | Early morning or late afternoon for cooler temps and fewer crowds. |
| **2** | **Old Montreal (Vieux‑Montréal)** | Historic ambience, street performers, souvenir shops, and the **Old Port** waterfront. | Free (optional carriage ride $15‑$20) | Weekday mornings for the best photo light. |
