| **5** | **Montreal Museum of Fine Arts** | Family‑friendly tours, interactive art stations, sculpture garden. | $0 entry (museum ticket $20‑$25, kids ≤ 12 free) | Check the schedule for “Kids’ Day” workshops. |
| **6** | **St. Joseph’s Oratory** | Impressive basilica, panoramic city views, peaceful garden. | Free (donations optional) | Late afternoon for the best sunset view. |

