### Suggested 3‑Day Family Itinerary (mix of trending & classic)

| Day | Morning | Midday | Afternoon/Evening |
|-----|---------|--------|-------------------|
| **Day 1** | **Mount Royal Park** – walk to the Kondiaronk Belvedere, rent a paddle‑boat on Beaver Lake. | Picnic lunch at the park. | **La Grande Roue de Montréal** (Ferris Wheel) for sunset views; dinner in Old Montreal. |
| **Day 2** | **Biodome** → **Insectarium** (both in the Space for Life complex). | Lunch at the **Jean‑Talon Market** (grab fresh fruit & poutine). | **Saint‑Lawrence River Cruise** (1‑hour) – relax while the kids spot the skyline from the water. |
| **Day 3** | **Hop‑On‑Hop‑Off Bus** – start at Old Montreal, hop off at the **Science Centre** (IMAX). | Lunch at the Old Port waterfront. | **Chasse au trésor** (scavenger hunt) that leads you through Old Montreal and ends at the **Biosphère** on Parc Jean‑Drapeau. End with a beach sunset or a quick ride on the **Ferris Wheel** if you missed it. |

